            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rdFN6",
              "name": "完整规则",
              "fill": "#B2AFA8",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Thinking → Running tools → Completed → Review → Apply.\nActive summary/output: 144 px viewport with scrolling. Finished steps fold automatically. Completed + elapsed time groups the full activity log; expand to inspect summaries, commands and output.\nRead document / Check headings / Draft edits prepare suggestions only. Apply to document commits them; Keep original discards them. Stop ends the current generation; Try again starts a new request.\nComposer action: Send (↑) switches to Stop (□) while running, then returns to Send. No separate Stop button.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Kqoad",
